{"seq":11,"slug":"global-competitive-analysis","title":"全球电商竞品分析","stage":"DONE","category":"global-ecommerce","chapterCount":6,"docCount":18,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis","rating":{"composite":3.89,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.39,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"全球电商竞品分析-简介\">全球电商竞品分析 简介</h1><p>本知识库聚焦一个明确的能力：<strong>系统化地分析全球电商竞争对手</strong>——从方法论框架、主要平台与区域格局，到把分析洞察转化为差异化定位与护城河。它回答的核心问题是「竞争对手在做什么、为什么这样做、我该如何应对」，而不是「我自己该怎么运营/获客/履约」。后者属于本目录下的兄弟知识库。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>全球电商目录（25_global-ecommerce）由多个互补的知识库组成。本 hub 是「竞争视角」的中枢，与兄弟 hub 的边界如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你想解决的问题</th>\n<th>去这里</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>竞争对手分析、平台对标、区域竞争格局、差异化与护城河</td>\n<td><strong>本 hub</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全球市场趋势、出海大势、品牌全球化战略全景</td>\n<td><a href=\"../global-strategy-trends/\">全球战略趋势</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨境运营落地、店铺与团队的日常经营</td>\n<td><a href=\"../cross-border-operations/\">跨境运营</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税务、海关、数据隐私与法律风险合规</td>\n<td><a href=\"../compliance-tax-legal/\">合规税务法律</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付通道、跨境物流、海外仓与供应链金融的执行</td>\n<td><a href=\"../global-payments-logistics/\">全球支付与物流</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品牌出海、全球营销、信任与口碑建设</td>\n<td><a href=\"../brand-internationalization/\">品牌国际化</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索流量获取、多语言搜索与区域搜索优化</td>\n<td><a href=\"../global-ecommerce-search/\">全球电商搜索</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多市场本地化、文化适配与市场进入方法</td>\n<td><a href=\"../global-localization/\">全球本地化</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：本 hub 帮你<strong>看清对手与战场</strong>并据此定位；兄弟 hub 帮你在选定战场后<strong>把仗打出来</strong>。当本 hub 的某篇 L4 涉及具体执行（如物流对标、支付竞争），文末「延伸阅读」会指向对应兄弟 hub 的执行细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内容结构\">内容结构</h2><p>本知识库 6 章 18 篇，按「方法 → 对象 → 战场 → 行动」展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第 1 章<strong>竞品分析框架</strong>：分析方法论、数据采集工具、竞争情报系统——竞争分析的「怎么做」。</li>\n<li>第 2 章<strong>主要平台分析</strong>：亚马逊、Shopee/Lazada、Temu/SHEIN——必须看懂的头部对手。</li>\n<li>第 3 章<strong>新兴市场</strong>：东南亚、拉美、中东非洲三大增长市场的竞争格局。</li>\n<li>第 4 章<strong>市场战略</strong>：区域竞争格局、差异化战略、竞争应对——从分析到反应。</li>\n<li>第 5 章<strong>技术与产品</strong>：搜索推荐、供应链物流、支付金融三条竞争对标主线。</li>\n<li>第 6 章<strong>战略定位</strong>：差异化设计、市场定位、护城河构建——竞品分析的最终落点。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径-分人群\">推荐学习路径（分人群）</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>战略分析师 / 竞争情报岗</strong>：第 1 章建立方法论 → 第 5 章掌握技术对标维度 → 第 6 章把洞察落到定位。重点读「竞争分析方法论」与「竞争情报系统」。</li>\n<li><strong>电商运营 / 业务负责人</strong>：第 2 章看清头部对手 → 第 3 章选定你要进的区域 → 第 4 章学竞争应对。可跳过第 1 章的体系化细节，按需回查。</li>\n<li><strong>投资 / 研究人员</strong>：第 2 章读商业模式 → 第 6 章「竞争护城河构建」判断长期壁垒 → 第 4 章「区域市场竞争格局」做市场分层。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>无论哪条路径，建议都以第 1 章的分析框架为锚、以第 6 章的护城河视角收尾——前者保证分析不流于罗列，后者保证结论指向长期竞争力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>电商基本概念（GMV、获客成本、履约、平台/自营模式）。若不熟悉，先看 <a href=\"../../ecommerce/ecommerce-fundamentals/\">电商基础知识库</a>。</li>\n<li>基础的竞争战略词汇（差异化、护城河、市场细分）。第 4、6 章会用到波特竞争战略与 STP 框架，无需精通，文中均有解释。</li>\n<li>对产业组织经济学（网络效应、进入壁垒、寡头竞争）有概念性了解会更易读懂护城河与定位章节，相关链接在各篇文末「延伸阅读」给出。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"competitive-framework","title":"竞品分析框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/competitive-framework","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"competitive-analysis-methodology","title":"竞争分析方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/competitive-framework/competitive-analysis-methodology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-collection-tools","title":"竞争数据采集与工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/competitive-framework/data-collection-tools"},{"seq":3,"slug":"competitive-intelligence","title":"竞争情报系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/competitive-framework/competitive-intelligence"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"major-platforms","title":"主要平台分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/major-platforms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"amazon-platform-analysis","title":"Amazon 平台竞争力分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/major-platforms/amazon-platform-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"shopee-lazada-analysis","title":"Shopee 与 Lazada 竞争分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/major-platforms/shopee-lazada-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"temu-shein-analysis","title":"Temu 与 Shein 竞争模式分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/major-platforms/temu-shein-analysis"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"emerging-markets","title":"新兴市场","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/emerging-markets","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"southeast-asia-competition","title":"东南亚电商竞争格局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/emerging-markets/southeast-asia-competition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"latin-america-competition","title":"拉美电商竞争格局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/emerging-markets/latin-america-competition"},{"seq":3,"slug":"middle-east-africa-competition","title":"中东非洲电商竞争格局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/emerging-markets/middle-east-africa-competition"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"market-strategy","title":"市场策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/market-strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"regional-competition-landscape","title":"区域市场竞争格局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/market-strategy/regional-competition-landscape"},{"seq":2,"slug":"differentiation-strategy","title":"差异化战略与竞争定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/market-strategy/differentiation-strategy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"competitive-response","title":"竞争应对与战略调整","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/market-strategy/competitive-response"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"technology-product","title":"技术与产品","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/technology-product","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"search-rec-benchmarking","title":"搜索与推荐系统竞争对标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/technology-product/search-rec-benchmarking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"supply-chain-logistics","title":"供应链与物流竞争对标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/technology-product/supply-chain-logistics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"payment-fintech-competition","title":"支付与金融科技竞争","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/technology-product/payment-fintech-competition"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"strategic-positioning","title":"战略定位","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/strategic-positioning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"differentiation-strategy","title":"差异化战略设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/strategic-positioning/differentiation-strategy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"market-positioning","title":"市场定位方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/strategic-positioning/market-positioning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"competitive-moat","title":"竞争护城河构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-competitive-analysis/strategic-positioning/competitive-moat"}]}]}